{"post_stream": {"posts": [{"id": 528870, "name": "Rénich Bon Ćirić", "username": "renich", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/renich/{size}/47_2.png", "created_at": "2026-09-05T13:48:58.113Z", "cooked": "<p>Hello Fedora Packagers &amp; Users!</p>\n<p>In conjunction with the <a href=\"https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Changes/CrystalLanguage\">Fedora 46 System-Wide Change Proposal: Crystal Language</a> and the active <a href=\"https://forge.fedoraproject.org/packaging/guidelines/pulls/1568\">Packaging Guidelines Review (PR #1568)</a>, we are actively organizing the <strong>Fedora Crystal SIG</strong>.</p>\n<p>The SIG coordinates the packaging, bootstrapping, and lifecycle maintenance for the Crystal compiler (<code>crystal-lang</code>), package manager (<code>shards</code>), RPM macros, and the unbundled Shard-as-RPM library ecosystem across Fedora and EPEL.</p>\n<h3><a name=\"p-528870-communication-resources-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-528870-communication-resources-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a>Communication &amp; Resources</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>SIG Wiki Page</strong>: <a href=\"https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/SIGs/Crystal\" class=\"inline-onebox\">SIGs/Crystal - Fedora Project Wiki</a></li>\n<li><strong>Fedora Chat (Matrix)</strong>: <a href=\"https://matrix.to/#/#crystal:fedora.im\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">#crystal:fedora.im</a> (IRC bridge: <code>#fedora-crystal</code> on Libera.Chat)</li>\n<li><strong>FAS/Noggin Group</strong>: <code>crystal-sig</code> (requested via <a href=\"https://forge.fedoraproject.org/infra/tickets/issues/13540\">Infra Ticket #13540</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>Guidelines Pull Request</strong>: <a href=\"https://forge.fedoraproject.org/packaging/guidelines/pulls/1568\">packaging/guidelines#1568</a></li>\n<li><strong>Development Workspace</strong>: <a href=\"https://codeberg.org/renich/crystal-in-fedora\" class=\"inline-onebox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">renich/crystal-in-fedora: Project to take Crystal to Fedora Linux and make it a first-class citizen there. - Codeberg.org</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3><a name=\"p-528870-were-looking-for-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-528870-were-looking-for-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a>We’re Looking For:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Packagers</strong>: Anyone interested in co-maintaining compiler components or packaging shard libraries and CLI tools (e.g. <code>ameba</code>, <code>flaw</code>, <code>kemal</code>).</li>\n<li><strong>Testers</strong>: Testing native RPM builds, offline shard symlinking, and dependency trees in Rawhide mock chroots.</li>\n<li><strong>Language &amp; Tooling Enthusiasts</strong>: Providing feedback on macro design and buildroot integration.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Feel free to stop by <code>#crystal:fedora.im</code> or join the SIG via the wiki!</p>", "post_number": 1, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 1, "updated_at": "2026-09-05T13:48:58.113Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 4, "reads": 16, "readers_count": 15, "score": 23.2, "yours": false, "topic_id": 201364, "topic_slug": "get-involved-fedora-crystal-sig-matrix-room-crystal-fedora-im", "display_username": "Rénich Bon Ćirić", "primary_group_name": "packager", "flair_name": "packager", "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": "", "flair_color": "", "flair_group_id": 68, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "link_counts": [{"url": "https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Changes/CrystalLanguage", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "Changes/CrystalLanguage - Fedora Project Wiki", "clicks": 1}, {"url": "https://forge.fedoraproject.org/packaging/guidelines/pulls/1568", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "Making sure you're not a bot!", "clicks": 0}, {"url": "https://forge.fedoraproject.org/infra/tickets/issues/13540", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "Making sure you're 